BUILDS DIFFERENTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Eon Stones during each expedition: run-based upgrades that reshape your abilities. Modify skills. Amplify status interactions. Unlock new Fusion paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earlier choices shape later options. No two runs feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHORT SESSIONS. FULL ARC.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission escalates through structured combat phases, optional high-risk objectives, mini-bosses, multi-phase boss fights, and competitive 2v2 PvP arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose, you finish a complete arc in one focused session. No 45-minute doomed matches. No filler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION WITHOUT THE GRIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, unlock permanent loadouts, Guardian Vault upgrades, and Tactical Calldown abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't grind to reach the real game. You're already playing it.</p>","developers":["Eon Rush Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/header.jpg?t=1771625290","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2557020/852325657/7100f09743eb79a5bfe2bcdfe22641875bebf30a/1771343416/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771344916","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2557020/852325657/7100f09743eb79a5bfe2bcdfe22641875bebf30a/1771343416/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771344916","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.st